ent-WH40KClothingHeadHatLeland = Crown of Justice
    .desc = An old sheriff's hat with crooked brims.

ent-WH40KClothingHeadCapLeland = lawman's cap
    .desc = A uniform cap with a cracked visor.

ent-WH40KClothingUniformJumpsuitLeland = worn patrol uniform
    .desc = A worn service uniform steeped in the smell of sweat and ozone.

ent-WH40KClothingOuterJacketLeland = leather jacket
    .desc = A thick jacket made of coarse fabric. Its shoulder seams are scorched and charred in places.

ent-WH40KClothingOuterCoatLeland = heavy leather coat
    .desc = A long greatcoat made of thick woollen cloth. It reliably protects the body from damp and conceals the horrific scars of electrical burns.

ent-WH40KClothingShoesBootsLeland = kirza boots
    .desc = Kirza does more than protect your feet from shit and mud.

ent-WH40KClothingBackpackLeland = mobile power pack
    .desc = A bulky, makeshift backpack power supply. Electrolyte bubbles inside while copper coils hum under immense voltage.

ent-WH40KStunbatonLeland = modified stun baton
    .desc = A hefty homemade baton made of three rods, conducting a lethal dose of electricity. Is it switched on?!
